onnects to our Linear instance), or if we hit a common error in our backend (it's connected to Datadog), we've trained Grok Bot to either add to the existing issue or to create a new one. Grok Bot also reproduces the issue with a video, which helps the engineering team quickly resolve it.\"}]\n36:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Of course, we also need to ensure that our customers are getting a clear response from us. We've trained Grok Bot on over one million customer interactions so that it's learned our tone and voice directly from our humans. Grok Bot is trained to not only respond, but always push the ticket towards resolution. It does this by asking relevant questions (i.e., it won't ask a question where the answer is already found in our logs).\"}]\n37:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Grok Bot can also take action on behalf of our customers. For example, we've provided it with clear refund instructions where 99% of all refund requests are resolved without human intervention.\"}]\n38:[\"$\",\"figure\",null,{\"className\":\"not-prose my-12 lg:-mx-12\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"bg-card overflow-hidden rounded-2xl\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L32\",null,{\"src\":\"https://media.x.ai/v1/website/grok-bot-customer-support-refund-c952d80e.webp\",\"alt\":\"Grok Bot confirming a refund on a support thread\",\"layout\":\"fullWidth\",\"className\":\"w-full\",\"aspectRatio\":1.606425702811245,\"blurhash\":\"LkOW1_s:8xspoL$ks:nj8xs;xuV@\"}]}],\"$undefined\"]}]\n39:[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"id\":\"managing-the-queue-in-real-time\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"className\":\"heading-anchor\",\"href\":\"#managing-the-queue-in-real-time\",\"children\":\"Managing the queue in real time\"}]}]\n3a:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Resolving individual tickets is only part of the job. We also need to understand what is happening across the queue. Grok Bot watches inbound volume continuously and adjusts the queue based on what needs attention. It can reprioritize tickets, reassign ownership based on urgency, and alert the organization when we are getting close to breaching a response-time SLA.\"}]\n3b:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Grok Bot also looks across tickets for patterns. When the volume around a particular issue reaches a set threshold, it can declare an incident automatically. It monitors X for changes in sentiment and recurring reports of the same problem, giving us a view beyond the customers who contact support directly. Together, these signals help us spot emerging problems early.\"}]\n3c:[\"$\",\"figure\",null,{\"className\":\"not-prose my-12 lg:-mx-12\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"bg-card overflow-hidden rounded-2xl\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L32\",null,{\"src\":\"https://media.x.ai/v1/website/grok-bot-customer-support-incident-b3f2d249.webp\",\"alt\":\"A Slack alert flagging a possible incident before paging anyone\",\"layout\":\"fullWidth\",\"className\":\"w-full\",\"aspectRatio\":1.4154281670205238,\"blurhash\":\"LJC4n%n%}Ir?-C=Ms:w}]qspfks:\"}]}],\"$undefined\"]}]\n3d:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"At our current scale, raw volume alerts would create a lot of noise. Grok Bot assesses whether a spike reflects a real support issue and begins investigating before it alerts the team. That gives us more context about what requires action while preserving the team's time and capacity.\"}]\n3e:[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"id\":\"continually-improving-our-customer-support-system\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"className\":\"heading-anchor\",\"href\":\"#continually-improving-our-customer-support-system\",\"children\":\"Continually improving our customer support system\"}]}]\n3f:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"As Grok Bot took on more of our customer support work, it also gave us a new way to improve the operation itself. It reviews customer interactions handled by both people and Bots, provides specific feedback on what could be improved, and surfaces coaching opportunities for individual team members and Bots.\"}]\n40:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Every week, Grok Bot sends our leadership team a summary of where our AI responses are falling short. Sometimes the answer is more training or better documentation. Other times, the summary confirms that the guardrails we put in place are working. This gives us a regularly updated view of quality and helps us address patterns early.\"}]\n41:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"As more users ask Grok for support, our help center increasingly serves as source material for its answers. To keep those answers accurate, Grok Bot reviews changes to our codebase and suggests corresponding updates to the help center.\"}]\n42:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"We have now reached the point where Grok Bots can coach other Grok Bots. They identify gaps in the knowledge system, fill those gaps, and feed what they learn back into the system. We are scaling this loop across the portfolio so that it covers every product surface.\"}]\n43:[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"id\":\"turning-customer-support-data-into-decisions\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"className\":\"heading-anchor\",\"href\":\"#turning-customer-support-data-into-decisions\",\"children\":\"Turning customer support data into decisions\"}]}]\n44:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Grok Bot has become our default data analyst, turning what it sees across customer support into daily reports for our Slack channels. When it detects early signs of a poor customer experience, it flags the situation so the team can step in while there is still time to change the outcome.\"}]\n45:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"An example of this is whenever a ticket goes back and forth more than three times between a customer and one of our team members (human or Bot). When that happens, Grok Bot flags the interaction for management review and gives leadership an opportunity to lean in and save the experience. This interaction helps train Grok Bot, and as Grok Bot learns which signals are useful to the team, the reporting becomes more relevant over time.\"}]\n46:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"The same analysis helps us improve product quality. Grok Bot synthesizes more than 20,000 points of product feedback from customer support tickets each day and turns them into clear themes we can bring to engineering. This gives the product team a broader view of where customers are struggling and where the product needs work.\"}]\n47:[\"$\",\"figure\",null,{\"className\":\"not-prose my-12 lg:-mx-12\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"bg-card overflow-hidden rounded-2xl\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L32\",null,{\"src\":\"https://media.x.ai/v1/website/grok-bot-customer-support-themes-eb5918b6.webp\",\"alt\":\"Grok Bot summarizing today's engineering themes from Plain tickets\",\"layout\":\"fullWidth\",\"className\":\"w-full\",\"aspectRatio\":1.0136847440446022,\"blurhash\":\"LfOC?d$+8x$*S1sps:e.8_W.b]Rj\"}]}],\"$undefined\"]}]\n48:[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"id\":\"how-grok-bot-changes-a-customer-support-team\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"className\":\"heading-anchor\",\"href\":\"#how-grok-bot-changes-a-customer-support-team\",\"children\":\"How Grok Bot changes a customer support team\"}]}]\n49:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Grok Bot is still a new way of working, but it has already changed how our team operates. Instead of spending most of the day on repetitive support work, we can focus on setting guardrails, handling cases that require judgment, and deciding how the operation should improve. That makes the work more engaging and gives people more room to apply their experience to harder problems.\"}]\n4a:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"We are still learning what this model makes possible. As the role of customer support continues to change, we will keep sharing what we find.\"}]\n4b:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"not-prose flex flex-col items-center gap-6 text-center mt-20 mb-10 lg:mt-24 lg:mb-12\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",n